    {"id":"summary-text","type":"text","x":55,"y":770,"width":1320,"height":140,"text":"A: shared LiteLLM managed identity for models, agents and MCP. Azure tests passed.\nB: separate app-alpha LiteLLM managed identity + isolated key database. Azure tests passed.\nC: MCP native user OBO; agents custom Python user OBO inside LiteLLM. Models use pod identity.\n2026-11-26: no-sidecar MCP + background A2A verified. Cross-user task isolation remains unverified.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#000000"},
    {"id":"footnote","type":"text","x":35,"y":965,"width":1370,"height":35,"text":"Workload identity = pod token mechanism, not a sidecar. Hosted downstream uses runtime identity; Blob uses FastMCP identity.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":2,"strokeColor":"#000000"}
